    <item>
      <title>0.3.2 (202611182130)</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:32:44 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611182130</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
- **Updates install by themselves.** The app checks every hour and installs a new version when you quit it. Opened from the disk image or Downloads, it first offers to move itself into Applications, where updates can reach it.
- The Domains card shows each certificate record's own value.
- A partner sees a client's sites only while the client shares Sites in SRG+ Connect.
]]></description>
