    <item>
      <title>0.3.2 (202611162353)</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:55:52 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611162353</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
What's new in SRG+ Sites 0.3.2

- Share a site's preview: a new Share menu can open the preview to everyone (it stays hidden from search), or make a client link that works for 1, 3, 7 or 30 days and copies it for you.
- A cleaner site window: the site's name, status, address and last release sit in the toolbar, with Reload, Open preview, Roll back and Publish next to them.
- Back and Forward arrows and a search button (Cmd-F) above the list of sites.
- Pages: one slim header per page with its share picture, address, title, description and search status, plus Copy link and Open. The Pages tab now opens at once.
- CMS has a tab of its own: collections on the left, the items in a table, and an item's fields.
]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/srgplus/srgplus-sites-macos/releases/latest/download/SRG-Plus-Sites.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="ViwImjLP160blErfhCuDnxf9WQvdSl/2sHY3ODVVqaMbg6Mpw5WV9gvlrQxVhrmc6lD8CE/eT1XlEYlBMaLADg==" length="6128148" />
